public boolean isPowerOfThree(int n) {
    if (n <= 0) return false;
    while (n % 3 == 0) {
        n /= 3;
    }
    return n == 1;
}
```
This solution uses a while loop to repeatedly divide n by 3 until it is no longer divisible by 3. If the result is 1, then n is a power of 3. Otherwise, it is not a power of 3. The solution has a time complexity of O(log n) and a space complexity of O(1).
